      "id": 1,
      "text": "Carpinteria’s name comes from the Spanish word for “carpentry,” a nod to the town’s early canoe‑building history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
